IP / LICENSE NOTICE

This repository is the work product of a hiring challenge for KV Capital.
Per the challenge terms, KV Capital owns the intellectual property in this work.

It is provided to KV Capital for evaluation. No open-source license is granted.
All adjustment-magnitude constants not sourced from CREB are US/North-American
proxies included for illustration and to be locally calibrated; they are not
representations of Calgary market values. All comparable-sale ("comp") data in
the viewer is SYNTHETIC and clearly labeled as such. Subject characteristics are
grounded in public Open Calgary assessment data.
